Design notes:
  - OP: virtual node, soft-matched from 5 static prototypes (EDA)
  - CONDITION edges: broadcast operating context to frequency nodes
  - DRIFT edges: energy coupling (vortex <-> BPF_DRIFT modulation), non-harmonic
  - HARMONIC edge: BPF_LINE → 2×BPF (r=2.0), sole deterministic relationship
  - No self-loops; no classifier-based condition prediction

